{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36834","headline":"春日投钱塘元帅尚父二首 二 · 罗隐","name":"春日投钱塘元帅尚父二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征东幕府十三州，敢望非才忝上游。\n官秩已叨吴品职，姓名兼显鲁春秋。\n盐车顾後声方重，火井窥来焰始浮。\n一句黄河千载事，麦城王粲谩登楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36834.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36834","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}